# The 1941 scenario as the Axis side, written by hand: a paratroop drop. In June 1941, COMMANDS,
# Paratroop: the From menu (Berlin and Krakow, the two cities with an Elite army the planes can
# carry), Berlin, then the To menu, which shows one city at a time: Down to Bern, and Enter. The
# drop ends at a "press a key" pause. Back at COMMANDS, the Paratroop row is blank. At the update of July
# the force lands in Bern. Then END TURN every month to the end, the Hall of Fame, and Quit.
#! seed 1941
#! cfg side=2

# Waits that any key ends; any menu not named below: Enter.
rule 1 key space
rule 2 key enter

# The title menu: Start NEW Game. Start Year: 1941, the third entry.
play until 2:W
text s
play until 2:S
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter

# COMMANDS, Paratroop: the From menu.
play until 2:M
digest
text c
play until 2:C
digest
text p
prompt
digest
# Berlin: its one Elite army goes straight to the To menu, which starts at Berlin.
key enter
prompt
digest
# Down: the next city in range, Bern. Enter: the drop.
key down
prompt
digest
key enter
# The pause after the drop.
prompt
digest
key space
# COMMANDS again, with the Paratroop row blank: Esc to the main menu.
play until 2:C
digest
key esc

# END TURN. At the update the force lands in Bern.
rule 2:E text y
play until 2:M
text e
play until 2:M
digest

# END TURN every month to the end.
rule 2:M text e
text e
play until 4
text Tester
key enter
prompt
digest
key space
prompt
digest
key space

# Back at the title menu: Quit, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:W
digest
text q
repeat space
